<h2>New Article Published</h2>

<p>A new article has been published on the platform.</p>

<p>
    <strong>Author:</strong> {{ author.email }}<br>
    <strong>Title:</strong> {{ article.titre }}<br>
    <strong>Description:</strong><br>
    {{ description|nl2br }}
</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('article_feed')) }}#article-{{ article.id }}">
        View this article in the feed
    </a>
</p>
